# ORIGINAL PUBLIC synthetic title page, authored for Apollo; no reference/private source.
# Hand-derived from docs/export-profile.md, not an engine dump.
# Title begins at 4: Harbor, blank, Signal. Credit begins at 10, takes two slots.
# Two two-line authors occupy 15-18; source is two slots below the last, at 20-21.
# Five authored contact lines end at 48: Office44, blank45, Lane46, Port47, phone48.
# Two draft-date lines are bottom-aligned at 47-48. Contacts x=374.4pt; dates x=108pt.
# Other title fields center at 306pt using 7.1953125pt per Unicode character.
# Empty authored lines (title5/contact45) occupy slots but have no PDF glyphs.
# Body pages retain number=none and number=2. whether the title is included or omitted.
